<title>CANADA: Canada says resuming lumber figures on Friday.</title>
<headline>Canada says resuming lumber figures on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada will resume publication of a daily update of its softwood lumber exports to the United States on Friday, international trade spokeswoman Nicole Bourget said on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday she had said the numbers should resume on Thursday, but because of crossed signals in the trade department and they were delayed until Friday morning.</p>
<p>At the end of September, Canada temporarily suspended the daily publication of export updates due to a change in the system for processing export permits.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745</p>
</text>
